    "body": "Thanks for the bug report, this is intentional but I didn't realized it would have this consequence.\n\nI did wrote code to fold:\n```\n(ADDQ x (MOVBQZX (SETCS flags))) => (ADCQ x (Const64 [0]) flags)\n```\nHowever I had to remove it before submitting the CL because it kept breaking compilation and I didn't investigated at the time, but the same bug showed up later (#79887) so I know why this happen and how to fix it.",
