    "body": "I might as well fix:\n```diff\npackage carry\n\nimport \"math/bits\"\n\nfunc SubUseAddCarry(a, b [2]uint64, s uint64) uint64 {\n\t_, c := bits.Add64(a[0], b[0], 0)\n\t_, c2 := bits.Add64(a[1], b[1], c)\n-\treturn s + c2 // carry consumed by a plain add\n+\treturn s - c2 // carry consumed by a plain sub\n}\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
